    <string name="newphone_step3">3. Copy the backup file to the new phone.</string>
    <string name="newphone_step4">4. On the new phone: open the More tab, tap “Restore backup”, and pick the file.</string>
    <string name="newphone_step5">5. Check Home and the till, then stop using the old phone for billing.</string>
